  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved labour market indicators and labour surveys</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will continue supporting the constituents of Uzbekistan in producing and analysing quality statistics as well as strengthening development of the labour market information systems integrated in the national statistical systems. ILO will support a survey on recruitment practices and working conditions in catering sector by provision of advice and guidance by ILO statisticians and experts throughout the implementation process. The model questionnaires, ensuring application of the latest international statistics standards adapted to the national context will be provided by the ILO for the constituents to develop survey questionnaire.</narrative>
  </description>
